```mdl
verdict resolveSurfaceMarkers: Marker derivation exists as a component memo, not an op.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-map-solid/src/components/MapSurface/MapSurface.tsx]
  note: |
    The `markers` memo in `MapSurface` queries objects of the View's type via `useQuery` and reads the pivot field's
    GeoPoint, dropping malformed rows. There is no operation or exported function named `resolveSurfaceMarkers`;
    QA-1 itself notes it is a reactive derivation, not an invocable op.
```

